Your covariate estimate seems unchanged, but your intercept changes.

The uncertainty is supposed to be reduced as you increase E.

I suspect your scale=1 case has a lot of zeroes, or low numbers. Could you do a table (truncated at y=5) for each scale?

Kind regards,
Haakon

